#: extension/prefs.js:223
msgid "HD Microphone"
msgstr "Micrófono HD"

#: extension/prefs.js:224
msgid ""
"Experimental. Adds a high-quality microphone input, named after your AirPods "
"with “(HD)”, that keeps playback in high quality while recording. Choose it "
"in the Sound settings."
msgstr "Experimental. Añade una entrada de micrófono de alta calidad, con el nombre de los AirPods seguido de «(HD)», que mantiene la reproducción en alta calidad durante la grabación. Se elige en la configuración de Sonido."

#: extension/prefs.js:236
msgid "Automatic Connection"
msgstr "Conexión automática"

#: extension/prefs.js:237
msgid ""
"Connect when you put your AirPods in or start playing, unless another device "
"is using them"
msgstr ""
"Conectar al ponerse los AirPods o iniciar la reproducción, salvo si otro "
"dispositivo los está usando"

#: extension/prefs.js:242
msgid "Switch With Your Apple Devices"
msgstr "Cambiar con sus dispositivos Apple"

#: extension/prefs.js:243
msgid ""
"Experimental. The AirPods move between this computer and your iPhone, iPad "
"or Mac on their own, as between Apple devices. This computer then presents "
"itself as an Apple device to Apple accessories. The AirPods reconnect "
"briefly when this is turned on."
msgstr ""
"Experimental. Los AirPods pasan solos de este ordenador a su iPhone, iPad o "
"Mac, como entre dispositivos Apple. Este ordenador se presenta entonces como "
"un dispositivo Apple ante los accesorios de Apple. Los AirPods se reconectan "
"brevemente al activarlo."

